            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Compare and analyse your justifications. How can one decide if an object is in motion or at rest?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.812,
            0.884,
            0.895
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "An object is said to be in "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "motion",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " if its position changes with respect to the reference point with time. If an object is not changing its position with respect to the reference point with time, it is said to be at rest."
            }
